Mark Shot source package provenance
===================================

PPA uploads must use the archive generated by GitHub from an official stable
upstream tag as the orig tarball. Draft and prerelease GitHub releases are not
eligible. The publication workflow verifies this through the canonical
jswysnemc/mark-shot GitHub release API before creating a source package.

The Debian revision format for Resolute is:

    <upstream>-0ppa<N>~resolute1

Only files below debian/ are added to the official upstream source archive.
Launchpad receives a signed source upload and builds all binary packages.
